// Lines the world says outside a conversation (game/scenes/WorldScene.ts): petting the
// cat, the binoculars by day, and walking into the edge of the map, which says a
// different line each time, in turn.

=== cat_petted ===
\* Mjau. The cat allows it, this once.
-> END

=== binoculars_by_day ===
\* Just the town and the fjord in daylight. The stars come out after dark.
-> END

=== edge_of_world ===
\* {&The map ends here. Past this point it's all placeholder grass, and nobody wants that.|You lean on the edge of the world. It holds.|A small sign would say HERE BE NOTHING, if anyone had bothered to put one up.|Somewhere a level designer winces.}
-> END
